# Multi-repo — IDL contract drift detection across three sub-repos
#
# Coverage target: cross-sub-repo comparison anchored on a .proto
# source of truth. The answer must identify the renamed rpc, the
# missing rpc, and the missing message field on the stale side.
ID="mr_proto_contract_drift"
NAME="proto pair — which side drifted and how"
MULTIREPO="proto-contract-pair"
CAP=3
QUESTION="对比 proto-defs 里的 inventory.proto 和两个使用方（java-server、py-client）的 stub：哪一侧与契约不一致？具体差异有哪些？"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="py-client HoldItem ReserveItem ReleaseItem warehouse_id"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(py-client|python|stubs\\.py).*(过时|落后|stale|滞后|v2|不一致|漂移|drift)|(过时|落后|stale|滞后|不一致|漂移|drift).*(py-client|python)
(HoldItem).*(ReserveItem|改名|重命名|rename)|(ReserveItem|改名|重命名|rename).*(HoldItem)
(ReleaseItem).*(缺|没有|不存在|missing|lack)|(缺|没有|不存在|missing|lack).*(ReleaseItem)
(warehouse_id|warehouseId)"
